<title>JORDAN: Jordan seeks advisers in sale of telecoms stake.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks advisers in sale of telecoms stake.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan announced on Wednesday it was seeking financial advisers to help divest a 26 percent stake in its profitable telecommunications monopoly to a strategic partner.</p>
<p>It said it sought applications by 1300 GMT on Tuesday 15</p>
